<h1>YAAR @VERSION@</h1>
<p>A desktop app for reviewing what a coding agent changes, while it changes it.</p>
<p>The source, the releases and the install line are at <a href="https://github.com/Tsadoq/yaar">github.com/Tsadoq/yaar</a>.</p>
<p>This site holds the install script and the apt repository. The apt repository and the checksums of every release are signed by the key at <a href="@BASE_URL@/apt/yaar-review.asc">@BASE_URL@/apt/yaar-review.asc</a>. Its fingerprint:</p>
<pre>@FINGERPRINT@</pre>
</body>
